  "description": "You know those actors who seem to spend their entire careers in supporting roles, yet manage to steal every scene? I think about that when I get great al pastor tacos—the crisp-edged pork is the star, but it'd be nothing without that sweet roasted pineapple. Here, pineapple graduates from supporting role to star.",
